Turf — Third-Party Notices
==========================

This archive distributes two binaries:

  * turf-mcp-server — the Turf infrastructure MCP server. Made available for
    evaluation under the PolyForm Free Trial License 1.0.0 (see LICENSE).
  * turf            — the reference Turf CLI. Open source under the Mozilla
    Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0).

The released turf CLI is built without CGO on every platform, so its
voice/audio capture is inactive in these binaries; text chat and all MCP
tooling are unaffected.

Source for the MPL-2.0 turf CLI is available on request: contact
eronwright@gmail.com.

Both binaries incorporate third-party open-source software. The principal
redistributed components and their licenses are listed below. The complete set
of dependencies corresponds to those declared in each component's Go module
(go.mod). Where a component is licensed under MPL-2.0, its source is available
at the URL given (or on request); the binaries themselves contain no
modifications to those components beyond what is published at those sources.

